    "text": "Comparing features to a stored model identifies which person it is.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 121.3
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_49f9be89765fab5ffd4c",
     "sg_2d826efe371c1c511092"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:40:09.809401",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:40:09.809401"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_a0bfe2059800",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "The mouth/nose transformation makes the voice almost unique per person.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 160.5
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_6de9d1e52b8116d9eac6",
     "sg_0c9527c36390b47fa0e3"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:40:09.809401",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:40:09.809401"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_3f2a261188a2",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "Not perfect but enough to use; additional features include voice dynamics, rate of speech, and emotion detection.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 203.8
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_7899a5df6a67ee013e60",
     "sg_833b4095db97208bdace",
     "sg_22fe29abd5addb30c83e",
     "sg_2664077b8cf1594b1929"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:40:09.809401",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:40:09.809401"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_81369cfe1279",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "Motivation for separation: voice recognition of needs, plus designing a sensitive table (mirroring) and a prototype to analyze conversations.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 601.7
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_13151bc64c1c50d7910a",
     "sg_aa57fb5f41fcd56b2281"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:50:15.826316",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:50:15.826316"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_85962afe671f",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "If two people speak at once, voice recognition is not reliable on such a stream \u2014 you should separate them first; once you have locations the rest is not a big problem.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 643.5
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_aa57fb5f41fcd56b2281"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:50:15.826316",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:50:15.826316"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_04a2036e4efb",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "System must work in different conditions (cafeteria, library); a single fixed threshold is a problem \u2014 currently using a kind of calibration.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 844.8
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_768757ad4e6245a3c8d0",
     "sg_5e1455fc541b5d214f95",
     "sg_836a8d2ab09e0a868578"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039066",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039066"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_e6bcc27b7e9b",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "Calibration: each person speaks in front of the mic; subtract the level kept in the other microphones.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 891.0
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_4ad6d0cbe7231f5c6d8a",
     "sg_68e8f3b778c22baf5755"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039066",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039066"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_1bd6736a8f10",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "Another paper on single-channel calibration with code online is offered.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 904.5
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_9c782b41a3933c7b2c00",
     "sg_b4af496edbcfc74b1e52"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039066",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039066"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_94bad6d406c8",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "Clustering locations over time to get small clusters of speech \u2014 needed since spontaneous speech words are quite small.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 924.4
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_62a17901ea03b2155e4f",
     "sg_cbc350898ef3b0a7be70",
     "sg_33c656c24b3c5f14d430"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039580",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039580"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_4bf5102b5f99",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "Speaker wraps up the discussion (\"otherwise yeah i'm done\").",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 956.9
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_b4e8b8e99fa59af20957"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039580",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:56:18.039580"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_36669a91f7ea",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "Event granularity: a detected event is a sum of small parts; short words like \"yes\" create many small events, so very small intervals must be considered.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 961.3
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_96904a0b679af133f4a9",
     "sg_c7e637758031c34708f0",
     "sg_c907255095d5ee9ab771"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:58:29.739549",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:58:29.739549"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_28f8f50eec67",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "First prototype focuses on quantity of speech (how long/much someone speaks); participation details like \"yes yes yes\" come later.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 1029.2
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
    "evidence": [
     "sg_fd977da133bb1f790510",
     "sg_3461edc7ad88d3009cd8",
     "sg_07b290b974817fa81502"
    ],
    "created_at": "2026-08-15T23:58:29.741064",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-15T23:58:29.741064"
   },
   {
    "id": "it_160c449fd8b5",
    "card": "timeline",
    "text": "Wrap-up: speaker will send paper links (some long, just briefly look); plan to go see Olivier.",
    "data": {
     "start_s": 1064.2
    },
    "status": "proposed",
    "author_type": "agent",
    "author_id": "agent",
    "pinned": false,
    "revision": 1,
