   },
   {
    "id": "it_b78df992300a",
    "card": "live_notes",
    "text": "Presenter will send paper links and they plan to go see Olivier. The idea to enter an email address so the app mails the results was well received, though OCR may not be installed on this computer. The application is entirely MATLAB-based; for online real-time use MATLAB is not trusted, so the most expensive part would need to be coded, possibly mixing MATLAB with other programming.",
